ormation\n\nWindows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9144) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11800H @ 2.30GHz (16 threads) - 63.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you specify a custom icon for a class and then use the \"Show list of selectable nodes at position clicked\" in the 3D editor and click on that node. The size of the custom icon does not seem to be constrained. \nSee this image:\n\n<img width=\"1857\" height=\"1008\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3013f6b5-c35e-4524-a243-d7a4fbe45401\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create custom class with icon\n2. Use \"Show list of selectable nodes at position clicked\" to click on it\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24881533/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0